## Conclusions

EPICS has shown itself to be useful as a slow controls system in a high-energy physics detector application. The EPICS - HDLC interface has proven to be a reliable, inexpensive alternate data acquisition path. EPICS will be used in the low-level control and monitoring of the STAR subsystems, while Experiment Controls will take charge in the high-level operation of the experiment.

